\section IO_intro_files Source files

| File | Content |
|---|---|
| simulation.py | the orchestrator RadClusterSimulation |
| input_data.py | the class \ref py_utils::input_data::InputData "InputData", which reads the workbook |
| cpp_bridge.py | the bridge to the C++ solver |
| post_process.py | derived quantities and conservation diagnostics |
| visualization.py | the standard figures |
| size_distributions.py | figures of measured size distributions |

\sa \ref Solver_intro, \ref Solver_modes

*/
